  "description": "A handwritten signature pad for Blazor with no JavaScript at all. Capture is pointer events\n\t\t\ton an SVG, rendering is SVG, and the PNG export is written in C#: a rasterizer and a PNG\n\t\t\tencoder, no canvas and no interop. Ink, size, smoothing, stroke width, texts, icons and\n\t\t\ttoolbar are parameters, and everything has a default.",
  "iconFile": "icon-512.png",
